data_pts2
# Phase identity: cxr-mc crystal catalog entry [pts2].
# Bundled full-basis P1 CIF used by the declarative material catalog.
# Catalog provenance and assumptions:
# Layered 1T-PtS2 (P-3m1): Furuseth, Selte & Kjekshus, Acta Chem. Scand. 19,
# 257--258 (1965), COD 1537200. Their experimental redetermination gives
# a=b=3.5432, c=5.0388 A and S 2d z=0.227. The weakly bonded layers stack
# along c, so the catalog uses a c-axis-normal slab.
# Validation: pts2-p3m1-structure
_symmetry_space_group_name_H-M 'P 1'
_symmetry_Int_Tables_number 1
_cell_length_a 3.5432
_cell_length_b 3.5432
_cell_length_c 5.0388
_cell_angle_alpha 90.0
_cell_angle_beta 90.0
_cell_angle_gamma 120.0
